{"v":1,"id":"mwr8hsxc-oawb","mode":"backtest","formulaName":"My_formula_v2","code":"//==============================================================================\n//  SMA TREND CROSS  v2   (your system, with the weak points fixed)\n//  BUY : Fast SMA crosses above Slow SMA   (as before)\n//  SELL: Close crosses below Exit SMA      (as before)\n//\n//  What changed vs your version - change ONE switch at a time and re-run the\n//  Walk-Forward, so you can see which change helps and which does not.\n//   1. Optimise ranges are small and cannot overlap: Fast 10-100 < Slow 100-250 (DAILY bars).\n//      Your old Fast range (20-200) could go ABOVE the slow one, and Slow kept\n//      landing on its upper limit (200). Old grid ~140,000 combos, now 960.\n//   2. Liquidity filter (price + average traded value) - the old test bought\n//      stocks under Rs 20 and thin small caps. Default ON.\n//   3. Optional market filter: buy only if an index is above its 200-day SMA.\n//      Default OFF (type an index symbol to switch on). Sells are never blocked.\n//   4. Optional ranking: when more signals than free slots, take the strongest\n//      6-month momentum first. Default OFF.\n//   The 20% stop-loss in your results came from the Analysis SETTINGS, not from\n//   this formula: keep that setting the same in every test.\n//==============================================================================\n_SECTION_BEGIN(\"SMA Trend Cross v2\");\nSetBacktestMode(BacktestRegular);\nFastPeriod = Optimize( \"Fast SMA\", 20, 10, 100, 10 );\nSlowPeriod = Optimize( \"Slow SMA\", 130, 100, 250, 10 );\nExitPeriod = Optimize( \"Exit SMA\", 30, 10, 60, 10 );\n\nMinPrice     = Param( \"Min price (Rs)\", 30, 0, 100000, 5 );\nMinTradedVal = Param( \"Min avg traded value 50d (Rs)\", 10000000, 0, 1e12, 1000000 );\nMktSym       = ParamStr( \"Market index symbol (blank = off)\", \"^NIFTY50\" );\nRankOn       = ParamToggle( \"Rank signals by 6-month momentum\", \"Off|On\", 0 );\n_SECTION_END();\n\nFastSMA = MA( C, FastPeriod );\nSlowSMA = MA( C, SlowPeriod );\nExitSMA = MA( C, ExitPeriod );\n\nLiquid = C >= MinPrice AND MA( C * V, 50 ) >= MinTradedVal;\n\nMarketOK = 1;\nif( MktSym != \"\" )\n{\n    SetForeign( MktSym );\n    mc = C;\n    RestorePriceArrays();\n    MarketOK = mc > MA( mc, 200 );\n}\n\nBuy  = Cross( FastSMA, SlowSMA ) AND Liquid AND MarketOK;\nSell = Cross( ExitSMA, C );\n\nBuy  = ExRem( Buy, Sell );\nSell = ExRem( Sell, Buy);\n\nMaxOpen = 25;\n\nSetTradeDelays( 1, 1, 0, 0 );\nSetOption( \"MaxOpenPositions\", MaxOpen );\nSetPositionSize( 100 / MaxOpen, spsPercentOfEquity );          // when more signals than slots: strongest first\n\n\nPositionScore = IIf( RankOn, ROC( C, 126 ), 0 );\n\nPlot( C, \"Close\", colorDefault, styleCandle );\nPlot( FastSMA, \"Fast SMA\", colorGreen, styleLine );\nPlot( SlowSMA, \"Slow SMA\", colorRed, styleLine );\nPlot( ExitSMA, \"Exit SMA\", colorBlue, styleLine );\nPlotShapes( IIf( Buy, shapeUpArrow, shapeNone ), colorBrightGreen, 0, L, -20 );\nPlotShapes( IIf( Sell, shapeDownArrow, shapeNone ), colorRed, 0, H, -20 );\n\nif( Status( \"action\" ) == actionExplore )\n{\n    Filter = Buy OR Sell;\n    AddTextColumn( WriteIf( Buy, \"BUY\", \"SELL\" ), \"Signal\", 1.0 );\n    AddColumn( C, \"Close\", 1.2 );\n    AddColumn( FastSMA, \"Fast SMA\", 1.2 );\n    AddColumn( SlowSMA, \"Slow SMA\", 1.2 );\n    AddColumn( ExitSMA, \"Exit SMA\", 1.2 );\n    AddColumn( ROC( C, 126 ), \"6m ROC %\", 1.1 );\n}\n","symbols":["360ONE","AADHARHFC","AARTIIND","AARTIPHARM","AAVAS","ABB","ABBOTINDIA","ABCAPITAL","ABDL","ABFRL","ABLBL","ABREL","ABSLAMC","ACC","ACE","ACI","ACMESOLAR","ACUTAAS","ADANIENSOL","ADANIENT","ADANIGREEN","ADANIPORTS","ADANIPOWER","ADVENZYMES","AEGISLOG","AEGISVOPAK","AEQUS","AEROFLEX","AETHER","AFCONS","AFFLE","AIAENG","AIIL","AJANTPHARM","AKUMS","ALKEM","ALKYLAMINE","AMAGI","AMBER","AMBUJACEM","ANANDRATHI","ANANTRAJ","ANGELONE","ANTHEM","ANURAS","APARINDS","APLAPOLLO","APOLLO","APOLLOHOSP","APOLLOTYRE","APTUS","AR